version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-15"

repository-code: "https://github.com/vajagathalimd/DTHI_DATA"
url: "https://github.com/vajagathalimd/DTHI_DATA"

abstract: >-
  Reproducibility and derived-data package supporting a computational study
  that integrates human developmental transcriptomics, adult cortical
  transcriptomic maps, regulatory inference, perturbational transcriptomics,
  fetal spatial references, multiome evidence, virtual perturbation and
  external cortical phenotype maps. The prospective validation framework
  retained all seven prespecified gates; none passed as prespecified.

keywords:
  - human cortical development
  - transcriptomics
  - developmental transcriptomic hierarchy
  - imaging transcriptomics
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - regulatory genomics
  - autism
  - reproducibility

